    "Action: Load scenario via getTestScenario and inject via injectGameState.",
    "Expect: Start in MAIN_PHASE with Player 1 turn, Player 2 shield[0] = GD01-090, Player 2 slot2 has GD01-042 (no pilot), and Player 1 slot3 is a linked pair GD01-071 + GD01-097.",
