    "Action: Player 2 confirms burst choice with confirmed=true.",
    "Expect: GD01-090 moves from Player 2 shield area to Player 2 hand.",
    "Action: End Player 1 turn. On Player 2 MAIN_PHASE, play GD01-090 from hand as pilot onto Player 2 slot2 GD01-042_unit_p2_0001.",
    "Expect: Player 2 slot2 becomes linked (GD01-042 link includes Duo Maxwell), and the unit AP remains at its normal value (2) before enemy effects.",
    "Action: On the same Player 2 turn, attack Player 1 shield area with Player 2 slot2 to rest that linked unit, resolve battle confirmations, then end Player 2 turn.",
    "Expect: Player 2 slot2 stays linked and rested at end of turn, so it is a legal enemy Unit attack target on Player 1 turn.",
    "Action: Player 1 attacks Player 2 slot2 with linked slot3 GD01-071_unit_p1_0002 and selects Player 2 slot2 as the AP-2 target for GD01-071's [During Link][Attack] effect.",
    "Expect: GD01-090 continuous protection prevents enemy AP reduction, so Player 2 slot2 does not lose AP from that enemy effect during battle."
  ],
